#: mcprack/templates/admin/vaultwarden_wizard.html:2
msgid "Vaultwarden diagnostics"
msgstr "Diagnostika Vaultwardenu"

#: mcprack/templates/admin/vaultwarden_wizard.html:4
msgid "Vaultwarden connection wizard"
msgstr "Sprievodca pripojením k Vaultwardenu"

#: mcprack/templates/admin/vaultwarden_wizard.html:5
msgid ""
"Checks each prerequisite in order and stops at the first problem, so you can"
" fix one thing at a time instead of guessing from a raw error message."
msgstr ""
"Postupne skontroluje každý predpoklad a zastaví sa pri prvom probléme, aby "
"ste mohli riešiť jednu vec po druhej namiesto hádania z holej chybovej "
"správy."

#: mcprack/templates/admin/vaultwarden_wizard.html:25
msgid "All checks passed — Vaultwarden is fully configured and reachable."
msgstr ""
"Všetky kontroly prebehli úspešne — Vaultwarden je plne nakonfigurovaný a "
"dostupný."

#: mcprack/templates/admin/vaultwarden_wizard.html:27
msgid ""
"Edit <code>/etc/mcprack/env</code> on the mcprack host to fix the flagged "
"setting, then restart the mcprack service, then re-run this diagnostics "
"page."
msgstr ""
"Upravte <code>/etc/mcprack/env</code> na hostiteľovi mcprack a opravte "
"označené nastavenie, potom reštartujte službu mcprack a znovu spustite túto "
"diagnostickú stránku."

#: mcprack/templates/admin/vaultwarden_wizard.html:33
msgid "Back to servers"
msgstr "Späť na servery"

#: mcprack/templates/admin/vaultwarden_wizard.html:37
msgid "Migrate secrets between local storage and Vaultwarden"
msgstr "Migrácia tajných kľúčov medzi lokálnym úložiskom a Vaultwardenom"

#: mcprack/templates/admin/vaultwarden_wizard.html:38
msgid ""
"These are deliberate, one-off data moves — not automatic fallbacks. Neither "
"backend is ever chosen silently at request time based on live reachability; "
"which one is authoritative is decided purely by whether "
"<code>BW_SERVER</code> is configured."
msgstr ""
"Toto sú zámerné, jednorazové presuny dát — nie automatické záložné "
"mechanizmy. Žiadny backend nie je nikdy ticho vybraný za behu na základe "
"aktuálnej dostupnosti; ktorý z nich je autoritatívny, sa rozhoduje výhradne "
"podľa toho, či je nakonfigurovaný <code>BW_SERVER</code>."

#: mcprack/templates/admin/vaultwarden_wizard.html:44
msgid "Move local secrets into Vaultwarden"
msgstr "Presunúť lokálne tajné kľúče do Vaultwardenu"

#: mcprack/templates/admin/vaultwarden_wizard.html:47
msgid ""
"Run this once Vaultwarden has been newly configured, to move over whatever "
"accumulated locally while it was not."
msgstr ""
"Spustite toto po tom, čo je Vaultwarden novo nakonfigurovaný, aby ste "
"presunuli všetko, čo sa nahromadilo lokálne, kým nakonfigurovaný nebol."

#: mcprack/templates/admin/vaultwarden_wizard.html:54
msgid "Snapshot Vaultwarden secrets locally"
msgstr "Zálohovať tajné kľúče Vaultwardenu lokálne"

#: mcprack/templates/admin/vaultwarden_wizard.html:57
msgid ""
"Run this <em>before</em> a planned Vaultwarden outage. Vaultwarden's copy is"
" left untouched — afterwards you can unset <code>BW_SERVER</code> for the "
"duration and switch back once it's back up."
msgstr ""
"Spustite toto <em>pred</em> plánovaným výpadkom Vaultwardenu. Kópia vo "
"Vaultwardene zostane nedotknutá — potom môžete na dobu výpadku zrušiť "
"nastavenie <code>BW_SERVER</code> a prepnúť späť, hneď ako bude Vaultwarden "
"opäť dostupný."

#: mcprack/templates/admin/vaultwarden_wizard.html:62
msgid "Both actions require <code>BW_SERVER</code> to be configured and reachable."
msgstr ""
"Obe akcie vyžadujú, aby bol <code>BW_SERVER</code> nakonfigurovaný a "
"dostupný."

